=== Phase 6: Strategy for |n| ~ 10^43 ===
Generic fiber: E/Q(t): V^2=W^3-780tW+(-3(12t^3-65)^2+16900)
1. Compute MW(E/Q(t))  the known point gives a section.
2. k*section yields (n_k, x_k); height ~ k^2 * h(section).
3. For |n|~10^43: need k ~ sqrt(ln(10^43)/h) ~ sqrt(99/h).
4. Sieve mod 84=lcm(12,7): keep only k with x_k  5 mod 12, 7x_k.
5. Specialize and verify each surviving candidate.

=== Complete ===

